  "description": {
    "raw": "When under the effects of this spell, you can teleport up to 30 feet as a move action. You must end this movement in an unoccupied space that you can stand on within line of sight. Alternatively, you can spend a move action to teleport to a standing position from lying prone. Teleporting does not provoke attacks of opportunity.Mythic Walk through SpaceSource Mythic Adventures pg. 111\nYou can teleport as either a move action or a swift action, but never more than once per round. If you expend a move action and a swift action, you may teleport up to 60 feet.",
    "search_text": "\"when under the effects of this spell, you can teleport up to 30 feet as a move action. you must end this movement in an unoccupied space that you can stand on within line of sight. alternatively, you can spend a move action to teleport to a standing position from lying prone. teleporting does not provoke attacks of opportunity.mythic walk through spacesource mythic adventures pg. 111\\nyou can teleport as either a move action or a swift action, but never more than once per round. if you expend a move action and a swift action, you may teleport up to 60 feet.\"",
